# README maintenance

When editing **README.md**, keep it aligned with the repo:

- **Features**: reflect actual SPA routes and major screens (`frontend/src/App.tsx`). Do not list planned work as shipped.
- **Run locally**: document **`make install`** / **`make dev`** from the repo root; note API `:8080`, Vite default port, and `/api` proxy behavior (`frontend/vite.config.ts`).
- **Tech stack**: match **`frontend/package.json`**, **`backend/go.mod`**, and real integrations (MLB Stats API, not generic “real time” unless behavior is described accurately).
- **Configuration**: env vars must match **`backend/config/config.go`** and **`VITE_API_BASE`** usage in **`frontend/src/api/client.ts`**.
- **CI**: if check commands change, update the README and **`.github/workflows/ci.yml`** / PR template in the same spirit.

Prefer short tables and copy-pasteable commands. Link to **`.github/pull_request_template.md`** for contribution expectations rather than duplicating long policy text.
